```

And `evaluateAuditResolveGate(realCodeChanges, codeChangesCommitted, openThreadCount, unaddressedCount)`:
- blocked = realCodeChanges === false && openThreadCount > 0 && unaddressedCount > 0
- auditResolve = !blocked && openThreadCount > 0 && !lapPushed

