 * outputs/review_replies.json — no threadId AND no rootCommentId
 * (threadKeyOf() === null). Machine notices (red-head markers,
 * rework-consume payloads, prior blocked comments) arrive in this shape;
 * including them in the gh-957 coverage-gate denominator made the gate
 * unsatisfiable for PRs whose open threads are all null-id notices
 * (live: dmtools-dart PR #420 / gh-395 blocked-looping for a week).
 */
